    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44043" root="&#xA;                        نعم&#xA;                    " body-key="n1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَعِمَ عَيْشُهَُ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>His life was,</i> or <i>became, plentiful
and easy:</i> (Msb:) <i>was, or became, good,</i> or
<i>pleasant.</i> (Mgh.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَوْفٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَعِمَ</span>, aor. 
    
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَعُمَ</span></b> 
                        ,
is like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَضِلَ</span>, aor. 
    
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَعُمَ</span></b> 
                        , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَضِرَ</span>, aor 
    
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَعُمَ</span></b> 
                        . See the
latter. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْعِمْ ضَبَاحًا</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِمْ صَباحًا</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَرِبَ</span>
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَبَاحٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَعُمَ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نُعُومَةٌ</span>; (S, Msb;) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَعِمَ</span>; (S;) <i>It was,</i> or <i>became, soft,</i> or <i>tender,</i>
(S, Msb,) <i>to the feet.</i> (Msb.)

